<v Tobin  Low>GPT-3回应。

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:57.920
<v GPT-3>She would speak, but I couldn't hear her. I'd call out to her, but her voice was so faint that she might as well have been dead.
<v GPT-3>她会说话，但我听不到。我会呼唤她，但她的声音太微弱了，她可能和死人没什么两样。

