<v GPT-3>And I'm a ghost, and I'm in a spaceship, and I'm hurtling through the universe. And I'm a ghost, and I'm in a spaceship, and I'm hurtling--
<v GPT-3>而且我是个幽灵，我在一艘宇宙飞船里，我在宇宙中穿行。而且我是个幽灵，我在一艘宇宙飞船里，我正在穿行——

00:29:53.110 --> 00:30:04.900
<v Vauhini Vara>But then that happens to also be the experience of grief, where you feel untethered. You feel sort of lost in your experience of grief. You have no way of trying to integrate or understand what's going on.
<v Vauhini Vara>但那也恰好是悲伤的体验，你会感到没有依托。你在悲伤的体验中感到迷失。你没有任何办法去整合或理解正在发生的事情。

